        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christopher Tin, Jacqueline Horner-Kwiatek\n- Works: Calling All Dawns, Baba Yetu, Civilization IV\n- Organizations: Anonymous 4, Grammy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Civilization IV is a video game released in 2005, and \"Baba Yetu\" was its theme song.\n- Christopher Tin composed the song \"Baba Yetu\".\n- At the 53rd Grammy Awards, the album Calling All Dawns won Best Classical Crossover Album.\n- At the 53rd Grammy Awards, the song \"Baba Yetu\" won Best Instrumental Arrangement Accompanying Vocalist(s).\n- Jacqueline Horner-Kwiatek is a member of the ensemble Anonymous 4.\n- Jacqueline Horner-Kwiatek was a featured soloist on Christopher Tin's Grammy award-winning album Calling All Dawns.",
